Privacy Policy for Choice

Last updated: October 5, 2026

Choice is a decision app. It spins a wheel, flips a coin, and picks a random number.

Choice does not collect, transmit, or sell personal data. It has no account, no analytics, and no advertising. Nothing you enter is sent to the developer or to any third party.

Wheels, options, and the random-number range are stored only on your device. If you delete the app, that data is deleted with it.

The app does not collect data from children or from anyone else.

Questions: ddorohov.dd@gmail.com

If the app later adds advertising or analytics, this page will be updated before that version is released.
